icon.dds is expected here but is not committed to the repository because .dds
binaries are awkward to maintain in git.

Generate one with:

    convert assets/icon.png -define dds:compression=dxt5 -resize 256x256 \
        mod/FS25_FFBEnhancer/icon.dds

Or drop any 256x256 DDS file at this path. The mod will load without an icon
(the game falls back to a placeholder) but users won't see it in the mod list.
